From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:39:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Server-side grading: the server marks quizzes and scores
 simulations; lesson content and answers are no longer public

- /api/courses is an outline for the public; lessons come from members-only /api/courses/<id>/learn without answers
- POST /api/quiz/submit marks, records every attempt, reveals the answer key afterwards, completes the course and issues the certificate once
- update-progress no longer trusts a browser-supplied score
- Simulations: server-held transcript and objectives, AI score recorded by the server, unreadable grader output never becomes a pass
- Migration e5a7b9d1f2c4 adds lesson_attempts and roleplay_sessions (new tables only)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
